        "category": "class",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You understand some of the wild hunt's techniques and can use them to form a primal bond with a trusted ally, much as members of the hunt do. You speak and understand Fey, gain darkvision, and gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Additional Lore] feat for Hunting Lore.</p>\n<p>In addition, during your daily preparations, you can choose an ally as your hunting partner. They remain so until you choose a new hunting partner. You gain a wild link aura in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:60] that has the aura and primal traits. While your hunting partner is in the emanation of your wild link aura, they can speak and understand Fey and gain darkvision.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Hunting Partner]</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.journals.JournalEntry.vx5FGEG34AxI2dow.JournalEntryPage.ziik8rCyfxaYwFbz]{Wild Hunter}</p>"
        },
        "level": {
            "value": 8
        },
